# Agent worktrees: real git repos living inside this one, never content of it.
.claude/worktrees/

# Throwaway measurement probes. This project's real bugs have all been found by
# writing a small test that MEASURES something — a box blur's impulse response, a
# matrix against its transpose, which column of a ramp has tonal slope — rather than
# by reasoning about the code. Those probes are written, run once, and deleted; they
# are not part of the suite and must never be committed. The ZZ prefix keeps them at
# the end of an alphabetical test listing while they exist.
Tests/**/ZZ*.swift

# Proof evidence is regenerated by the suite; only the committed records are the record.
Tests/LumenCoreTests/Proof/evidence/
